*   **interior_luxury_rating**: 0.60. The interior uses high-quality materials like leather and Alcantara/Nappa leather, has a minimalist yet stylish design, and features like the Virtual Cockpit contribute to a premium feel (Source [4], [5], [6], [7], [8], [16], [17], [22], [25], [27], [32], [34], [38]). It's luxurious for its segment.
*   **interior_tech_focus_rating**: 0.70. The Audi Virtual Cockpit is a central, screen-forward element of the interior design, replacing traditional gauges and integrating most functions (Source [1], [2], [3], [4], [5], [7], [9], [10], [11], [19], [20], [25]). This gives the interior a strong tech focus.